    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the logs show the temp spike was way too sudden for a compressor failure—it's like it just dropped for a second then climbed. its really weird. i'm trying to figure out if it was a sensor error or if something actually broke. any idea what typically causes a sudden, unexplained spike like that in these units?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
