    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i had the tech look at the controller, but they couldn't find anything physically broken. like no loose wires or anything. it's just really frustrating because everything looks perfect on paper but the machine just acts up for no reason. is there any other reason a system would just... glitch like that? it feels almost intentional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
